    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Project Hailstorm</i> is a <strong>short, 15 minute long</strong> narrative driven story set deep within the Antarctic circle. Step into the shoes of a recovery team as they attempt to uncover what happened over half a decade ago.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNCOVER THE MYSTERY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel deep below the surface of the Antarctic and uncover just exactly <i>what</i> the dig team discovered that day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388760/extras/4641f04d910737098a72cadddd03cf40.poster.avif?t=1743764770\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388760/extras/4641f04d910737098a72cadddd03cf40.webm?t=1743764770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388760/extras/4641f04d910737098a72cadddd03cf40.mp4?t=1743764770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HIGH QUALITY SHORT-FORM GAMING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A videogame short story,\u00a0experience high quality visuals as you're moved through a dramatic and atmospheric environment set in the depths of the Antarctic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388760/extras/7743ecc907cafbd290753649a3ebe972.poster.avif?t=1743764770\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388760/extras/7743ecc907cafbd290753649a3ebe972.webm?t=1743764770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388760/extras/7743ecc907cafbd290753649a3ebe972.mp4?t=1743764770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCOVER THE BEHIND THE SCENES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a look at the behind the scenes documentary and look at what it takes to bring something like this to life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388760/extras/634882885174f2441e66d744197417b8.poster.avif?t=1743764770\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388760/extras/634882885174f2441e66d744197417b8.webm?t=1743764770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388760/extras/634882885174f2441e66d744197417b8.mp4?t=1743764770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Project Hailstorm</i> is a <strong>short, 15 minute long</strong> narrative driven story set deep within the Antarctic circle. Step into the shoes of a recovery team as they attempt to uncover what happened over half a decade ago.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNCOVER THE MYSTERY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel deep below the surface of the Antarctic and uncover just exactly <i>what</i> the dig team discovered that day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388760/extras/4641f04d910737098a72cadddd03cf40.poster.avif?t=1743764770\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388760/extras/4641f04d910737098a72cadddd03cf40.webm?t=1743764770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388760/extras/4641f04d910737098a72cadddd03cf40.mp4?t=1743764770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HIGH QUALITY SHORT-FORM GAMING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A videogame short story,\u00a0experience high quality visuals as you're moved through a dramatic and atmospheric environment set in the depths of the Antarctic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388760/extras/7743ecc907cafbd290753649a3ebe972.poster.avif?t=1743764770\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388760/extras/7743ecc907cafbd290753649a3ebe972.webm?t=1743764770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388760/extras/7743ecc907cafbd290753649a3ebe972.mp4?t=1743764770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCOVER THE BEHIND THE SCENES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a look at the behind the scenes documentary and look at what it takes to bring something like this to life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388760/extras/634882885174f2441e66d744197417b8.poster.avif?t=1743764770\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388760/extras/634882885174f2441e66d744197417b8.webm?t=1743764770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388760/extras/634882885174f2441e66d744197417b8.mp4?t=1743764770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
